# Raw live-Sheet inspection dumps ONLY — not the whole directory: two of the
# three files here are genuine throwaway caches (large, write-only, never
# read back by any script — `inspect-real-content-gaps.mjs` writes
# real-content-gaps-raw.json, nothing reads live-check-museum-arcade.json),
# but welcome-message-2026-09-22.json is authored seed input that
# seed-welcome-message.mjs, verify-welcome-browser.mjs, and
# verify-welcome-live-readonly.mjs all read via fs.readFileSync — excluding
# it would ship those three scripts broken. Sheets/Drive remain the sole
# source of truth per CLAUDE.md §4 either way; this JSON is the authored
# source for one Sheet row, not a duplicated parallel store.
scripts/content/*
!scripts/content/welcome-message-2026-09-22.json

# Live-verification browser evidence (screenshots/results from real-Sheet runs)
# — working artifacts, not formal milestone evidence; excluded from the
# release for size and privacy, unlike the small per-milestone screenshots
# under docs/reports/M00–M03 and docs/reports/PHASE1/, which stay tracked.
docs/reports/*_LIVE/
docs/reports/MANUAL_JOURNEY/
docs/reports/PHASE1_PRESENTATION/
docs/reports/PHASE1_REAL_ART/
docs/reports/PHASE2/
docs/reports/JOURNEY_POLISH/
docs/reports/SCENE_POLISH/

# Ahmed's personal working notes referencing his own local screen recordings
# (not stored in the repo) — excluded from the release at his request.
/Veoulla_Manual_Journey_Fixes.md
